  message: "2026-06-10 design-interview ruling (ADR-0035, merged in PR #4181): move/rename tracking is assigned to fingerprint/shape_id (stable_id deliberately churns on moves), which makes this file-vs-function fingerprint collision load-bearing rather than cosmetic. The comment-stripping conflation needs fixing so cross-kind nodes cannot assert content-identity. Waits on the implementing fingerprint fix."  # 8cae
